01:54:55,389 --> 01:54:59,142
<i>John Park and JAE JAE, please leave.</i>

2139
01:55:00,644 --> 01:55:03,397
-You did so well. What an experience.
-Good job.

2140
01:55:03,480 --> 01:55:05,023
-Good job.
-You too.

2141
01:55:05,107 --> 01:55:07,317
-His wish came true.
-Yeah, it did.

2142
01:55:07,401 --> 01:55:09,027
See you in twelve hours.

2143
01:55:09,111 --> 01:55:10,362
Cheer me on tomorrow.

2144
01:55:10,445 --> 01:55:11,655
-You got this.
-Good luck.

2145
01:55:11,738 --> 01:55:12,572
-Good luck.
-I'll do my best.

2146
01:55:13,615 --> 01:55:15,659
I feel like I learned so much here.

2147
01:55:16,535 --> 01:55:17,369
Seriously.

2148
01:55:18,328 --> 01:55:22,290
<i>At the beginning,</i>
<i>I was a bit down and intimidated.</i>

2149
01:55:22,374 --> 01:55:25,335
<i>I was busy complaining about</i>
<i>how I didn't stand a chance.</i>

2150
01:55:25,419 --> 01:55:27,170
<i>But after going through all the stages</i>

2151
01:55:27,254 --> 01:55:28,797
<i>and experiencing some hardships,</i>

2152
01:55:28,880 --> 01:55:31,091
I did my very best
to make myself believe in myself.

2153
01:55:31,174 --> 01:55:35,345
I kept telling myself,
"I can do it. There's no reason I can't."

2154
01:55:35,429 --> 01:55:39,474
<i>Endless self-affirmations</i>
<i>really made it happen.</i>

2155
01:55:39,558 --> 01:55:42,185
<i>The sense of achievement</i>
<i>and the experience itself</i>

2156
01:55:42,269 --> 01:55:44,312
were things I hadn't felt in a long time.

2157
01:55:44,396 --> 01:55:46,398
<i>Everything that happened in the exile zone</i>

2158
01:55:46,481 --> 01:55:48,692
<i>will remain</i>
<i>an unforgettable chapter of my life.</i>

2159
01:55:48,775 --> 01:55:49,943
Nothing is impossible.

2160
01:55:50,026 --> 01:55:53,113
The only thing keeping you back
is the word "impossible."

2161
01:55:53,196 --> 01:55:54,531
That's what I learned here.

2162
01:56:00,078 --> 01:56:02,038
There are so many memorable moments.

2163
01:56:02,122 --> 01:56:06,460
First, the beginning of our journey
to take down Dong-min's allies one by one.

2164
01:56:06,543 --> 01:56:09,045
<i>I felt a little guilty,</i>
<i>but it was also exhilarating.</i>

2165
01:56:09,129 --> 01:56:11,339
<i>JAE JAE, XITSUH, and I losing our minds,</i>

2166
01:56:11,423 --> 01:56:13,550
<i>crunching numbers</i>
<i>during Tower of Equations.</i>

2167
01:56:13,633 --> 01:56:17,387
<i>And the time I spent today</i>
<i>going one-on-one with Dong-min.</i>

2168
01:56:17,470 --> 01:56:19,222
I enjoyed every moment of it.

2169
01:56:19,306 --> 01:56:22,559
<i>Every single second of the games</i>
<i>brought me so much joy,</i>

2170
01:56:22,642 --> 01:56:25,145
<i>and the prison matches were even more fun.</i>

2171
01:56:25,228 --> 01:56:28,523
I feel like I gave it my all each time.

2172
01:56:30,775 --> 01:56:31,902
So I'm proud of myself.

2173
01:56:33,528 --> 01:56:34,779
This was so much fun.

2174
01:56:36,990 --> 01:56:40,160
<i>Hyun Kyung-lyul</i>
<i>will advance to the finals.</i>

2175
01:56:41,286 --> 01:56:42,454
<i>Hyun Kyung-lyul,</i>

2176
01:56:42,537 --> 01:56:44,623
<i>please make your way to the living area.</i>

2177
01:57:12,359 --> 01:57:14,736
<i>On day one,</i>

2178
01:57:14,819 --> 01:57:18,490
<i>when I met all the players of Season 3,</i>

2179
01:57:18,573 --> 01:57:21,952
<i>I was truly impressed</i>
<i>and realized I could go home any day.</i>

2180
01:57:22,035 --> 01:57:24,746
<i>I spent that whole day</i>
<i>trembling in my boots.</i>

2181
01:57:25,330 --> 01:57:28,375
<i>But I've somehow</i>
<i>managed to beat all of them,</i>

2182
01:57:28,458 --> 01:57:30,335
and now I'm about to
go up against Dong-min,

2183
01:57:30,418 --> 01:57:33,171
<i>the god of survival shows.</i>

2184
01:57:33,255 --> 01:57:38,260
I think I earned this chance
through a mix of skill and luck.

2185
01:57:38,343 --> 01:57:40,595
<i>I'm gonna make</i>
<i>the most of this opportunity</i>

2186
01:57:40,679 --> 01:57:42,764
<i>and take on the god.</i>

2187
01:57:43,348 --> 01:57:44,766
-Well done.
-I'm here.

2188
01:57:45,767 --> 01:57:47,018
You did great.

